meta:
  origin:
    producer: Hoesly et al.
    title: Community Emissions Data System
    description: |-
      The Community Emissions Data System (CEDS) estimates emissions of air pollutants for each country, by sector and fuel. It covers black carbon (BC), carbon monoxide (CO), carbon dioxide (CO₂), ammonia (NH₃), non-methane volatile organic compounds (NMVOCs), nitrogen oxides (NOₓ), organic carbon (OC), and sulfur dioxide (SO₂) from 1750 to 2023, and methane (CH₄) and nitrous oxide (N₂O) from 1970 to 2023.
    title_snapshot: Community Emissions Data System – Bunkers
    description_snapshot: Supplementary data on bunker emissions of air pollutants by country, year, sector, and pollutant.
    citation_full: |-
      Hoesly, R., Smith, S. J., Ahsan, H., Prime, N., O'Rourke, P., Crippa, M., Klimont, Z., Guizzardi, D., Feng, L., Harkins, C., McDonald, B., & Wang, S. (2025). CEDS v_2025_03_18 Aggregate Data (v_2025_03_18) [Data set]. Zenodo. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15059443
    attribution: Hoesly et al. (2025) – Community Emissions Data System (CEDS)
    version_producer: v_2025_03_18
    url_main: https://zenodo.org/records/15059443
